  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru Economic Reform Phase Two</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will support&#xa0;improved economic governance through collaboration with the Asian Development Bank (ADB) in a programme that aims to strengthen Nauru&apos;s public investment management and fiscal sustainability.&#xa0;This follows&#xa0;successful achievement of&#xa0;outcomes in the first Phase of budget support in which New Zealand partnered with the ADB 2019-2020. It contains both a technical assistance and direct budget support component.</narrative>
  </description>
